{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13206310","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13206310","schema_version":1,"lang":"en","texts":{"narration:1:1320631001:0":{"text":"The sound loom starts up. At first, only the slow clicking sounds of gears and metal can be heard.","source_cn":"织言机启动了，起初像是金属缓慢摩擦的声音","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x51270DF2C3FE0752","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"narration:2:1320631002:1":{"text":"However, the sounds gradually change, and they start to sound more familiar.","source_cn":"","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x216AD4406A6464D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1320631003:1":{"text":"*Huff*... I need to run faster! Little Carly is still at the temple. She doesn't know Hypofiends have breached the temple grounds.","source_cn":"呼……呼……动起来，再快一点！小卡莎还在修道院，她不知...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD30E8C5166ED4AC2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1320631004:1":{"text":"*Mechanical sounds*","source_cn":"吱……咯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E92B94EBF43DC76","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1320631005:1":{"text":"Callan!","source_cn":"哥哥——铐兰哥哥！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x254718E76D90D75F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1320631006:1":{"text":"This is my brother's voice! This was before he went to the temple to find me...","source_cn":"这是哥哥的声音！是他去修道院找我之前……？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4CBABD4C39D77AA2","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1320631007:1":{"text":"Carly, are you injured...?","source_cn":"卡莎，你……你受伤了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x08969B9F9187EB24","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1320631008:1":{"text":"I-I don't know. What's happening?","source_cn":"我……我不知道，哥哥，发生了什么？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x575E086E80945584","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1320631009:1":{"text":"Dura above...","source_cn":"艾雅在上——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE10BC436F003B8EB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1320631010:0":{"text":"Callan's voice is drowned out by the sounds of loud explosions, buildings collapsing, and falling debris.","source_cn":"铐兰的声音被尖锐而巨大的爆破声淹没，那是火药爆炸、建筑...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0DE9BBF2063FE6EC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1320631011:1":{"text":"After these sounds, the howls of Hypofiends can be heard, followed by rapid breathing and running sounds...","source_cn":"在这些声音之后，传来了你们曾听过的魔物的尖啸声，然后是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x30914D0FCCE0D2AD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1320631012:1":{"text":"Suddenly, there is a pause. The sound of a mechanical opening can be heard, and then something huge moves away.","source_cn":"突然，一个停顿，机括开启的声音传来，有什么巨大的东西被...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2C691DFA0F6335E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1320631013:1":{"text":"Carly, hide inside and run back home as fast as you can!","source_cn":"——卡莎，你躲进去，用你最快的速度跑回家里！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9305AD8DDC78F671","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1320631014:1":{"text":"Rigel will take you somewhere safe. Don't be scared. You'll be fine...","source_cn":"瑞高尔管家会带你去避难，不用害怕，你会没事的……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBB8CC10B4C5312DF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1320631015:1":{"text":"Don't leave me, Callan! The Hypofiends are still out there! Don't leave me alone...","source_cn":"哥哥！别离开我！它们……那些魔物还在外面！别留我一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x058D6A7FDAB5948B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1320631016:1":{"text":"Carly, remember the fairy tale we read. You're a brave adventurer, and I'm a great mage who can defeat any monster.","source_cn":"小卡莎，想起我们小时候的故事。你是勇敢的冒险家，而我是...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCA73E909934C4A53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1320631017:1":{"text":"Now, run! Don't look back!","source_cn":"——现在，跑吧！不要回头！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB7EAFB44B4D33C28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:29:1320631018:1":{"text":"Callan... That was the moment we parted...","source_cn":"哥哥……那是我们离别的时刻……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x390702CA788F207A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:33:1320631019:0":{"text":"The sound loom continues to vibrate and hum. This time, you hear the bestial howls of pain and the sounds of a sharp weapon piercing flesh.","source_cn":"织言机继续嗡嗡震动着，这次，你们听到了魔物被击溃时的痛...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1FE2F0E73243B4C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1320631020:0":{"text":"You hear breathing suddenly stop. It's deathly quiet. However, soon, the breathing continues and becomes to become winded and painful.","source_cn":"近在咫尺的呼吸声突然止住了，死亡般安静。但是，很快，那...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C3D09D39518DFBF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1320631021:1":{"text":"Carly... I'm sorry.","source_cn":"卡莎……对不起……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x675E91AD2E6BAAE5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1320631022:1":{"text":"*Mechanical sounds*","source_cn":"吱……咯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA35EB6F69EB5350B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1320631023:1":{"text":"You wish to protect her also? *Cough*... We are indeed of one mind...","source_cn":"你也想继续保护她吗？不愧是我的，咳咳，造物……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xADE519CF8D0279E5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:39:1320631024:1":{"text":"My body can no longer move, but you can... You can continue protecting Little Carly forever...","source_cn":"我的身体……动不了了。但你还可以，结实又忠诚的机仆……...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x31E20E67B2877963","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:40:1320631025:1":{"text":"*Mechanical sounds*","source_cn":"吱吱咯……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8676EE843DD3D8D5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1320631026:1":{"text":"Very well. Lift me up so that the gods may stand witness... I remember a spell from a forbidden tome long ago.","source_cn":"很好……把我抬起来……像要敬献给神明那样……我在禁书上...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7B596D0512E18DB8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1320631027:1":{"text":"Fate must be smiling at us. You have an immortal body... while I have a living soul.","source_cn":"多巧啊，你有一具不朽的躯体……而我有一颗灵魂……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x24F83B7CABF975BD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1320631028:1":{"text":"This will hurt... Oh, Dura, fix your eyes upon me. Let me stay with her...","source_cn":"哦，这一定会很疼……但是艾雅……垂眸……注视我吧……让...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC5B582CB1CF8EE1B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1320631029:1":{"text":"...until the end of time.","source_cn":"……直到时间的尽头……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC497F1E707C69773","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1320631030:1":{"text":"There is a faint chanting of a spell followed by complete silence. No sound of the wind nor crackling of fire.","source_cn":"微弱的咒语吟诵。接着是完全的寂静。没有风声，没有火焰的...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE30D77553B83DD1A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1320631031:1":{"text":"Then, the sounds of machinery begin to hum.","source_cn":"直到机械开始作响。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFF5FD769E79FDCDA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1320631032:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1320631033:1":{"text":"Carolina...","source_cn":"……小卡莎……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8154F61981035FC4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1320631034:1":{"text":"...","source_cn":"…………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x70646B5D874C111A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1320631035:1":{"text":"Callan...","source_cn":"哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBF52C6E859291D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:52:1320631035":{"text":"Callan...","source_cn":"哥哥……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xEBF52C6E859291D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1320631037:0":{"text":"Callan did not fall to Hypogean magic...","source_cn":"……所以，铐兰并不是被恶魔束缚了灵魂。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB02C9528245DE28E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1320631038:1":{"text":"All of this was for Miss Carolina. Even if he had to change into his form and endure endless pain, he still wanted to protect his sister.","source_cn":"是为了卡列琳娜小姐。即便变成另一种姿态，忍受亘古的痛苦...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD9EF9B3B003E3B8E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1320631039:1":{"text":"That's the reason his soul resisted. He didn't want to leave Carolina.","source_cn":"这就是为什么他的残魂在抗拒。他不愿意离开卡列琳娜。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8929DF85FA74FE5E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1320631040:1":{"text":"However, if this continues...","source_cn":"但是，这样下去的话……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD7391F0827CD3D10","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:52:0:1":{"text":"He volunteered to be a golem.","source_cn":"听起来，他是自愿变成机械人偶","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xAD2D531E7214E238","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"He volunteered to be a golem.","female":"He volunteered to be a golem.","variant_male_record_index":"69296","variant_female_record_index":"69297","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice:52:1:2":{"text":"Callan kept his promise to you.","source_cn":"铐兰实现了他的诺言","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x75BEBEC87CE3A097","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"Callan kept his promise to you.","female":"Callan kept his promise to you.","variant_male_record_index":"69298","variant_female_record_index":"69299","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1320631036:1":{"text":"That's what my brother always called me...","source_cn":"你……你的话，和哥哥说过的一样……","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BFDF4E02A26159F","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"That's what my brother always called me...","female":"That's what my brother always called me...","variant_male_record_index":"147556","variant_female_record_index":"147557","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_t